  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard\" style=\"width:22em; font-size:88%;\"><tbody><tr class=\"adr\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\" class=\"mergedtoprow\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.25em 0.33em 0.33em;line-height:1.2em;font-size:1.25em;\"><span class=\"fn org country-name\">Association of Arab States</span><br /></th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n          <td class=\"maptable\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.5em 0;\"><table style=\"text-align:center;width:100%;background:none;\"><tbody><tr>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center;width:58%; vertical-align:middle;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/5f/Arab_Flag.png/revision/latest?cb=20170912051121\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Arabian Association\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/5f/Arab_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20170912051121\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"83\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Arab Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Arab_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center;width:auto;vertical-align:middle;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/3/3b/Arabia_CoA.png/revision/latest?cb=20170912051058\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Coat of arms of Arabian Association\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/3/3b/Arabia_CoA.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/85?cb=20170912051058\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"85\" height=\"83\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Arabia CoA.png\" data-image-key=\"Arabia_CoA.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n              </tr><tr>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Flag</td>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Coat of arms</td>\n              </tr></tbody></table>\n          </td>\n        </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b></td><td>Baghdad</td></tr>\n             <tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n               <th colspan=\"2\">Largest city</th>\n               <td>Jeddah</td></tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">National languages</th>\n         <td>English (official)</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">Regional languages</th>\n         <td>Arabic</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Government</th>\n         <td>Federal presidential constitutional republic</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">President</td>\n         <td>Saul Al-Saud</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Vice President</td>\n         <td>Moham Al-Falasi</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Legislature</th>\n         <td>Council of Assembly</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upper_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Upper house\">Upper house</a></td>\n         <td>High Council</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Lower house\">Lower house</a></td>\n         <td>High Assembly</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><th colspan=\"3\">Unification</th></tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Founded</td>\n         <td>November 16, 2139&#160;</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\">Population</th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n            <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n            <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">2160&#160;estimate</td>\n            <td>&gt;300 Million</td>\n          </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">Currency</th>\n           <td>United States Dollar (USD) </td>\n       </tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The Arabian Association is an <a href=\"/wiki/Associated_state\" title=\"Associated state\">associated state</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"United States\">United States</a> that was founded in 2139.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205733\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 542/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7780/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 765/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 4/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   17.770      1 Template:Infobox_country\n100.00%   17.770      1 -total\n 11.79%    2.095      1 Template:Yesno\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1933-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205733 and revision id 10675. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
